OL,3,GNEWSACountry house hotel expansion
OL,4,Acould deliver 60 jobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to expand a country house hotel
OL,7,Fin the south of Scotland could deliver
OL,8,Fup to 60 jobs to the area.
OL,10,FThe RAD Hotel Group has lodged an
OL,11,Fapplication to extend its Hetland Hall
OL,12,FHotel at Carrutherstown in Dumfries and
OL,13,FGalloway.
OL,15,FIt would include 26 extra bedrooms, a
OL,16,Fspa and wellness facility and the
OL,17,Fcreation of a new wedding and events
OL,18,Fspace along with 10 woodland lodges.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
